# Agent instructions for web

## Commands

- Test every package: `just test`
- Lint every package: `just lint`
- Start the web dev server: `just web-dev`

## Conventions

- Use TypeScript strict mode.
- Use Conventional Commits.
- Never commit secrets or .env files.
- Use CSS modules for component styles.

## Quality gate

`just ci` must exit 0 before you hand off work.
